# Home (D-135, one page): open SMS from its favourite (the middle column, inside the canvas on every panel) twice,
# then all apps and turn its pages.
@3s      snap  boot
+500ms   tap   50% 56%
+1500ms  swipe 50% 99% 50% 65% 400ms
+1500ms  tap   50% 56%
+1500ms  swipe 50% 99% 50% 65% 400ms
+1500ms  tap   50% 88%
+1500ms  key   next
+1800ms  key   prev
+1800ms  swipe 88% 55% 15% 55% 250ms
+1800ms  key   next
+1800ms  key   next
+1800ms  key   prev
+1800ms  key   prev
+1800ms  key   next
+2s      snap  end
+500ms   end
